# Notes with no input: every note plucks the tape loop, tuned to the note (Karplus-Strong). Legato steps glide, an
# octave jump crossfades, low velocity plucks softly, a bend detunes the ring; releasing returns to the echo, which
# repeats the last ring at P1's time.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2
track fx1
input silence
param p1 117
param p2 215
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 C3 4 120
note 4 E3 2 90
note 6 G3 2 90
note 8 C5 4 127
note 12 C2 4 127
note 16 A3 4 30
note 20 C4 6 110
bend 22 100
bend 24 -200
bend 26 0
note 28 F6 2 100
note 30 C7 2 100
note 34 F0 4 100
note 40 C9 4 100
expect sound 0 44
expect peak_below -1
